<group prefix="WebGpuSharp.FFI.">
    <comment location="RenderPassDescriptorFFI">
        <summary>            
            Describes the attachments of a render pass.

			For use with <see cref="WebGpuSharp.FFI. CommandEncoderHandle.BeginRenderPass"/>.
        </summary>
    </comment>

	<group prefix="RenderPassDescriptorFFI.">
		<comment location="ColorAttachmentCount">
			<summary>the number of color attachments in the colorAttachments sequence.</summary>
		</comment>
		<comment location="Label">
			<summary>A label to apply to the render pass.</summary>
		</comment>
	</group>
</group>